{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1496918-who-is-your-character-s-worst-enemy","id":1496918,"title":"Who is your character's worst enemy?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-12T09:50:24-08:00","id":1496918,"title":"Who is your character's worst enemy?","content":"Myself I play the great great grandchilde of the Brujah elder Tyler and I have members of the Hardstadt line coming for my head with a vengence as our clan is no longer a member of the Camarilla sect.<br /> <br /> So my current enemy is a Ventrue Archon who is the Great Grand-childe of Hardstadt The Younger who has a huge grudge against our clan and my lineage in particular and his group is outside of our domian and is engaging in acts of sabotage against our holdings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T10:53:51-08:00","id":1496924,"title":"","content":"Tough question - considering my character was an anathema who managed to fake his destruction in the 80s until very recently, i guess either the Inner Circle of the Camarilla who made him anathema, the justicars who hounded him until that one accident, or prince Francois Villon, who was determined and vengeful enough not to believe the official version and keep a small horde of minions tracking any hints of his continued existence in the intervening decades.<br /> <br /> More recently the truth of his continued existence has been confirmed but due to a number of circunstances and political jockeying, the Inner Circle and a number of elders have opted to mend bridges and thrown a rug over the matter instead of dealing with the potential fallout of that the public admission that a supposedly destroyed anathema outsmarted everybody for almost 4 decades would cause. Officially, now he's a member of the Unbound, a peculiar cabal of Lasombra antitribu, Tzimisce, a few bloodlines and Caitiff that forms a sort of 8th faction of the Camarilla, and a member of Chicago's Primogen at that.<br /> <br /> Villon still hates his guts, but he has also managed to make an enemy of Al-Ashrad, due to some even more recent interactions with Assamites of the Web of Knives and that call into question much of the rumors about the figure of Ur-Shulgi. his crusade and the true motives behind the Banu Haqim's exodus to the Camarilla.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 11-12-2022, 02:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T16:36:39-08:00","id":1496947,"title":"","content":"In Vampire? Themselves. Always.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T18:19:54-08:00","id":1496953,"title":"","content":"I have recently started a character after decades with playing and have managed to avoid making enemies so far. But I am pretty sure this won't last.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T22:51:03-08:00","id":1496966,"title":"","content":"The closest thing to a &quot;worst enemy&quot; I've had in VtM was when I played a Gangrel in Dark Ages, who absolutely hated and feared his sire.<br /> Like, I had the &quot;Nightmares&quot; flaw based solely ong how awful this sire was.<br /> So naturally, after escaping her clutches, my Gangrel dedicated the better part of fifty years to hunt and bring her down. In the end, he got to diablerize her <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Furthermore, I believe Carthage should be destroyed.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23835-pang4","name":"pang4","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value